; One variable: whether a text `.gltf` reaches its external files. The quad's geometry lives in
; `quad.bin` and its base colour in `checker.png`, beside the glTF. A load that misses the buffer
; draws the missing placeholder, and one that misses the image draws the quad untextured, which
; no `.glb` scene can show, since a `.glb` carries both inside it.

